### ─── AUTH ───
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### ─── RULES ───
### List Rules
GET http://localhost:3000/rules

### Create Rule
POST http://localhost:3000/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgId": "e6f12d9c-a007-4461-98c1-2c9684dde314",
  "name": "Forward Jobs",
  "description": "Forward job postings",
  "sourceChatIds": ["source-group-1@g.us"],
  "destinationChatIds": ["dest-group-1@g.us"]
}

### ─── WEBHOOK (Simulate Incoming Message) ───
POST http://localhost:3000/webhook/evolution
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "MESSAGES_UPSERT",
  "instance": "main-instance",
  "data": {
    "key": {
      "id": "3EB0C6D5B2A1F4E8",
      "remoteJid": "source-group-1@g.us",
      "fromMe": false
    },
    "pushName": "Test Sender",
    "message": {
      "conversation": "Hello! This is a test message for forwarding."
    },
    "messageTimestamp": 1721980800
  }
}

